  "coverage": [
    "Three ARM ABIs: 71 assertions each, direct syscalls without libc emulation",
    "Native pthread/process integration: 83 assertions; total 296 final guest assertions",
    "Delayed final-thread exit after group leader is observed in /proc as zombie",
    "SIGCHLD=SIG_IGN autoreap still wakes epoll and waitid reports ECHILD",
    "Close original pidfd with dup retained; epoll still wakes; 64 exit-versus-epoll-detach races",
    "Real numerical PID reuse after 723 allocator iterations: old pidfd cannot signal replacement task",
    "Nested PID namespace cannot signal ancestor pidfd; non-child pidfd cannot reap parent",
    "pids.max=0 denies 32 CLONE_PIDFD calls with EAGAIN and stable open-fd count; restoring limit permits fork and reap",
    "32 bad parent_tidptr clones clean up descriptors; EMFILE, incompatible flags and user signal permission/compat siginfo checks",
    "Same final fixture on kernel9 reports P_PIDFD EINVAL and all four probes exit77 unsupported"
  ],
